              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sab 132:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye kisigalik Abisai okoku loka Seruia ŋes, kinom Epilisitiat, koar ŋes. Kosodete ituŋa luka Daudi aiyapoikin ŋes atiar, “Mam bobo jo ilomari kasio ojie, kinyek aitudeŋ atala naka Isirael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
